  <diagram id="KxIvO8Vw94ufhBtJ73Jz" name="UC-6">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor Admin\n    participant UI as Account Detail UI\n    participant AccountAPI as Account API\n    participant AuditAPI as Audit API\n    participant Auth as Auth Service\n    participant AccountSvc as Account Service\n    participant AuditSvc as Audit Service\n    participant HistorySvc as Change History Service\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Nhấn View tại UC-05\n    UI-&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}\n    AccountAPI-&gt;&gt;Auth: Authenticate và authorize Admin\n\n    alt Session hết hạn\n        Auth--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Invalid session\n        AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 401 Unauthorized\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: MSG12\n        UI-&gt;&gt;UI: Mở Login\n\n    else Không phải Admin\n        Auth--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Forbidden\n        AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 403 Forbidden\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: MSG13\n\n    else accountId sai định dạng\n        Auth--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Authorized\n        AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 400 Bad Request\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Thông báo yêu cầu không hợp lệ&lt;br/&gt;và Back to list\n\n    else Được phép\n        Auth--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Authorized\n        AccountAPI-&gt;&gt;AccountSvc: Get account detail\n        AccountSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Query account, role,&lt;br/&gt;room, department và lock data\n\n        alt Không tìm thấy account\n            DB--&gt;&gt;AccountSvc: Not found\n            AccountSvc--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Not found\n            AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 404 Not Found\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: MSG41 và Back to list\n\n        else Tìm thấy account\n            DB--&gt;&gt;AccountSvc: Account data\n            AccountSvc-&gt;&gt;AccountSvc: Tính allowedActions&lt;br/&gt;từ requester, target, role và status\n            AccountSvc--&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: Account detail + allowedActions\n            AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Hiển thị thông tin read-only\n\n            par Tải Recent Activity\n                UI-&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/activities?limit=10\n                AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;Auth: Kiểm tra quyền Admin\n                Auth--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Authorized\n                AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;AuditSvc: Get recent activities\n                AuditSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Query 10 Login, Logout,&lt;br/&gt;Failed Login gần nhất\n                DB--&gt;&gt;AuditSvc: Activities\n                AuditSvc--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Activities\n                AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK\n                UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Hiển thị Recent Activity\n            and Tải Change History\n                UI-&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/change-history&lt;br/&gt;?page=0&amp;size=10\n                AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;Auth: Kiểm tra quyền Admin\n                Auth--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Authorized\n                AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;HistorySvc: Get change history\n                HistorySvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Query changedAt DESC,&lt;br/&gt;historyId DESC\n                DB--&gt;&gt;HistorySvc: Items + total count\n                HistorySvc--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Paginated history\n                AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK\n                UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Hiển thị Change History\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\n    loop Phân trang Change History\n        Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Chọn page hoặc page size\n        UI-&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/change-history?page&amp;size\n        AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;Auth: Kiểm tra session và quyền\n\n        alt Không hợp lệ\n            Auth--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Unauthorized hoặc Forbidden\n            AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 401 hoặc 403\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: MSG12 hoặc MSG13\n        else Hợp lệ\n            Auth--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Authorized\n            AuditAPI-&gt;&gt;HistorySvc: Get requested page\n            HistorySvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Query history\n            DB--&gt;&gt;HistorySvc: Items + total count\n            HistorySvc--&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: Result\n            AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 200 OK\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Cập nhật Change History\n        end\n    end\n\n    alt Back to list\n        Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Nhấn Back to list\n        UI-&gt;&gt;UI: Quay về URL UC-05 trước đó\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Khôi phục search, filter,&lt;br/&gt;sort, page và page size\n\n    else Chọn action được phép\n        Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Chọn Update, Assign Role,&lt;br/&gt;Lock/Unlock, Reset Password&lt;br/&gt;hoặc Assign Room\n        UI-&gt;&gt;UI: Mở use case tương ứng\n\n        Note over Admin,UI: Sau khi action hoàn tất\n\n        UI-&gt;&gt;AccountAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}\n        UI-&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/activities?limit=10\n        UI-&gt;&gt;AuditAPI: GET change-history?page=0&amp;size=10\n        AccountAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: Account mới nhất + allowedActions\n        AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: Activity và History mới nhất\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Làm mới toàn bộ nội dung\n    end\n\n    opt Recent Activity tải lỗi\n        AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 5xx\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Giữ Account Detail&lt;br/&gt;Activity hiển thị MSG99 + Retry\n    end\n\n    opt Change History tải lỗi\n        AuditAPI--&gt;&gt;UI: 5xx\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Giữ Account Detail&lt;br/&gt;History hiển thị MSG99 + Retry\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="1e7fjZ9-i29GflxQEiaK-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
